sb downloads and runs third-party programs. Their licences are theirs, not
this one's:

  nokk              Apache-2.0    https://github.com/koloss777/nokk
  obscura           Apache-2.0    https://github.com/h4ckf0r0day/obscura
  lightpanda        AGPL-3.0      https://github.com/lightpanda-io/browser
  moli              Apache-2.0    https://github.com/lexmount/moli
  curl-impersonate  MIT           https://github.com/lexiforest/curl-impersonate

sb does not modify, bundle or redistribute them; it fetches the upstream
release assets at install time and runs them as separate programs.
